{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_044_gan-title\">GAN</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">生成器与判别器通过同一 value function 对抗优化，以数据驱动判别器替代固定重建损失。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Generator and discriminator networks engage in a two-player minimax game, replacing hand-crafted pixel reconstruction losses with a learned adversarial critic.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">先验噪声 z 与真实数据样本 x</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Latent noise vector z ~ p_z(z) and real data samples x ~ p_data(x)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">逼近真实数据分布的生成样本</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Synthesized samples G(z) approximating the real data distribution</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper/2014/hash/f033ed80deb0234979a61f95710dbe25-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_044_gan')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_044_gan')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"GAN original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/0b06c4d30e085f8a04be.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_044_gan', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_044_gan\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_044_gan')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_044_gan', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_044_gan\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">先验噪声 z</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Prior Latent Noise z</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">从简单分布采样的 latent 随机向量提供生成多样性。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests latent noise vector z ~ p_z(z) and real data samples x ~ p_data(x) and prepares initial tensor representations (Prior Latent Noise z).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"从简单分布采样的 latent 随机向量提供生成多样性。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests latent noise vector z ~ p_z(z) and real data samples x ~ p_data(x) and prepares initial tensor representations (Prior Latent Noise z).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"先验噪声 z\" data-node-name-en=\"Prior Latent Noise z\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_044_gan', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">先验噪声 z</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Prior Latent Noise z</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从简单分布采样的 latent 随机向量提供生成多样性。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests latent noise vector z ~ p_z(z) and real data samples x ~ p_data(x) and prepares initial tensor representations (Prior Latent Noise z).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"可微网络把 z 映射为数据空间样本 G(z)。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Generator G to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Generator G\" data-node-name-en=\"Generator G\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_044_gan', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Generator G</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">可微网络把 z 映射为数据空间样本 G(z)。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Generator G to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"由 G 产生、训练时应逐渐接近真实分布的候选样本。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Synthesized Sample within the core adversarial generator discriminator game computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"生成样本\" data-node-name-en=\"Synthesized Sample\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_044_gan', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">生成样本</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Synthesized Sample</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">由 G 产生、训练时应逐渐接近真实分布的候选样本。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Synthesized Sample within the core adversarial generator discriminator game computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从未知真实数据分布采样，作为判别器正例。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Real Data Sample x within the core adversarial generator discriminator game computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"真实样本 x\" data-node-name-en=\"Real Data Sample x\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_044_gan', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">真实样本 x</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Real Data Sample x</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从未知真实数据分布采样，作为判别器正例。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Real Data Sample x within the core adversarial generator discriminator game computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"同一判别网络对真实和生成样本输出为真的概率。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Discriminator D within the core adversarial generator discriminator game computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Discriminator D\" data-node-name-en=\"Discriminator D\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_044_gan', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Discriminator D</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">同一判别网络对真实和生成样本输出为真的概率。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Discriminator D within the core adversarial generator discriminator game computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"奖励判别器把真实样本判断为真。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs log D(x) within the core adversarial generator discriminator game computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"log D(x)\" data-node-name-en=\"log D(x)\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_044_gan', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>log D(x)</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">奖励判别器把真实样本判断为真。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs log D(x) within the core adversarial generator discriminator game computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"判别器奖励识别假样本；生成器则通过相反方向欺骗 D。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies log(1−D(G(z to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"log(1−D(G(z)))\" data-node-name-en=\"log(1−D(G(z\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_044_gan', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">log(1−D(G(z)))</span><span class=\"lang-en\">log(1−D(G(z</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">判别器奖励识别假样本；生成器则通过相反方向欺骗 D。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies log(1−D(G(z to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"训练后丢弃判别器，通过采样 z 直接生成新数据。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces synthesized samples g(z) approximating the real data distribution via p_g.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"生成分布 p_g\" data-node-name-en=\"p_g\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_044_gan', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">生成分布 p_g</span><span class=\"lang-en\">p_g</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">训练后丢弃判别器，通过采样 z 直接生成新数据。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces synthesized samples g(z) approximating the real data distribution via p_g.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"GAN Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · GAN 生成器与判别器的 minimax 博弈</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Two-Player Minimax Adversarial Value Function Between Generator G and Discriminator D</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"GAN：核心公式 · GAN 生成器与判别器的 minimax 博弈\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"44\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"13.849221pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.852406 -69.079189 233.651752 13.849221\" width=\"233.651752pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M2.150838 0V-.081885C1.719579-.087344 1.632235-.141934 1.632235-.403965V-3.679353L1.588563-3.690271L.605947-3.193504V-3.117078C.671455-3.144373 .731503-3.166209 .753339-3.177127C.851601-3.21534 .944404-3.237176 .998994-3.237176C1.113632-3.237176 1.162763-3.155291 1.162763-2.980604V-.507685C1.162763-.327539 1.119091-.201982 1.031747-.152851C.949863-.103721 .873437-.087344 .64416-.081885V0H2.150838Z\" id=\"m044_g15-49\"></path><path d=\"M2.41287-.218359V-.360293C2.320067-.283867 2.254559-.256572 2.172674-.256572C2.047118-.256572 2.008905-.332998 2.008905-.573193V-1.637694C2.00